{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ家族と、河中湖オルゴールの森美術館に\n行ってきましたぁぁぁあヽ( ^o^ )ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お～しろっ  お～しろっ(*^ω^*) ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾜ━ヾ( o･∀)ﾉﾞヾ(o･∀･o)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中世ヨーロッパの\n王侯貴族になった気分っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術館 大好きっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンティークオルゴールやパイプオルガンなどの\n自動演奏楽器の世界観に魅了されて、\n大好きになっちゃいました  )^o^(素敵です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽とか、お花とか、アンティークとか、\nわたしの大好きなものが沢山あって\n幸せでした～( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りも、森に囲まれていて\n富士山も綺麗でしたし、\nまさに 森が好きなわたしにとって\n堪らない場所でした！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー堪らないっ！\n森に住みたいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかギンガの森に住んで、\n白馬に乗ったギンガマンさまが現れぇぇぇぇえぉうぃえ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花びらのツメェっっっ！キリッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、お休みなさゆませ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}